<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.00-56.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     50.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows:  mostly steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     scarce</p>
</text>
